  entry
    definition "assign to a lower position; reduce in rank"
    examples ("She was demoted because she always speaks up" "He was broken down to Sergeant")
    id oewn-02404473-v
    partOfSpeech v
    synonyms (demote relegate break "kick downstairs")
  entry
    definition "remove or force from a position of dwelling previously occupied"
